      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING KESTREL (1) is a newcomer for the Leeanne Goodwin kennel. Gets every chance from the inside draw. Respect any strong moves in the market. ARCANE LEGEND (6) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Ballarat over 450m behind Aston Grandeur (26.35) in a T3 RSTW. Has good early speed and can overcome the tricky draw. Expected to feature in the finish. CASPIAN (2) is super consistent without winning, landing six placings from eight starts. Hit the frame again last start finishing second (22.76) at Gosford. Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Expected to be in the finish again. ZIPPING ALBERTA (3) comes into calculations after placing at a short quote most recently.",
